msgid "%d agent session(s) are running and will be left as they are."
msgstr "%d 个智能体会话正在运行，将保持原状。"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Address the FCC server listens on. Keep 127.0.0.1 unless you need to reach the FCC Admin page from another device on your LAN — never expose this port to the internet."
msgstr "FCC 服务器监听的地址。除非你需要从局域网内的其他设备访问 FCC 管理页面，否则请保持 127.0.0.1 —— 切勿将此端口暴露到互联网。"

msgid "Agent"
msgstr "智能体"

msgid "Agent exited unexpectedly."
msgstr "智能体意外退出。"

msgid "Agents"
msgstr "智能体"

msgid "An interactive terminal running a coding agent on this router. Sessions keep running after you close this page, and reattaching to one restores its screen."
msgstr "在此路由器上运行编码智能体的交互式终端。关闭本页面后会话仍会继续运行，重新连接即可恢复其画面。"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

msgid "Are you sure you want to close this session?\nAll unsaved terminal state will be lost."
msgstr "确定要关闭此会话吗？\n所有未保存的终端状态都将丢失。"

msgid "Base directory for the FCC runtime. The runtime is placed in a “fcc” subdirectory, so /opt gives /opt/fcc. Changing this does not move an existing installation."
msgstr "FCC 运行时的基础目录。运行时会放在其下的“fcc”子目录中，因此 /opt 对应 /opt/fcc。修改此项不会移动已安装的运行时。"

msgid "Basic Information"
msgstr "基本信息"

msgid "Bind address"
msgstr "绑定地址"

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "正在检查…"

msgid "Choose which agents to install. The defaults are picked to fit this device's memory and free space; an agent that does not fit is left unchecked rather than failing the install."
msgstr "选择要安装的 Agent。默认选项会根据本机内存和可用空间挑选；放不下的 Agent 会保持未勾选，而不是让安装失败。"

msgid "Clean up finished sessions"
msgstr "清理已结束的会话"

msgid "Close its session first."
msgstr "请先关闭其会话。"

msgid "Close session"
msgstr "关闭会话"

msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置管理"

msgid "Could not attach to the session:"
msgstr "无法连接到会话："

msgid "Detecting versions…"
msgstr "正在检测版本…"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Done."
msgstr "完成。"

msgid "Enable FCC"
msgstr "启用 FCC"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "错误"

msgid "Exit code: %d"
msgstr "退出码：%d"

msgid "FCC"
msgstr "FCC"

msgid "FCC Runtime"
msgstr "FCC 运行时"

msgid "FCC Server"
msgstr "FCC Server"

msgid "Health"
msgstr "健康状态"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

msgid "Install / reinstall"
msgstr "安装 / 重新安装"

msgid "Install an agent first (Configuration → Agents)."
msgstr "请先安装一个智能体（配置管理 → 智能体）。"

msgid "Install path"
msgstr "安装路径"

msgid "Installation is blocked until the failed checks pass."
msgstr "在未通过的检查项通过之前，安装已被阻止。"

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "已安装"

msgid "Installing downloads the FCC runtime and the selected agents. This can take several minutes on a router; progress is shown below."
msgstr "安装过程会下载 FCC 运行时和选定的智能体。在路由器上这可能需要数分钟；进度显示在下方。"

msgid "Latest"
msgstr "最新"

msgid "Launcher"
msgstr "启动器"

msgid "Listening on"
msgstr "监听于"

msgid "Load"
msgstr "加载"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "正在加载…"

msgid "Log level"
msgstr "日志级别"

msgid "Logs"
msgstr "日志"

msgid "LuCI App"
msgstr "LuCI 应用"

msgid "Memory"
msgstr "内存"

msgid "Memory (RSS)"
msgstr "内存 (RSS)"

msgid "New session"
msgstr "新建会话"

msgid "No active sessions. Start one to open a terminal."
msgstr "没有活动会话。新建一个以打开终端。"

msgid "No agent sessions are running."
msgstr "当前没有正在运行的智能体会话。"

msgid "No agents are registered."
msgstr "没有已注册的 Agent。"

msgid "No agents in the registry."
msgstr "注册表中没有智能体。"

msgid "No agents installed"
msgstr "未安装任何智能体"

msgid "No entries yet."
msgstr "暂无记录。"

msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安装"

msgid "Open FCC Admin"
msgstr "打开 FCC Admin"

msgid "Opens the FCC Admin page in a new tab."
msgstr "在新标签页中打开 FCC 管理页面。"

msgid "PID"
msgstr "进程 ID"

msgid "Port"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "Re-detect versions"
msgstr "重新检测版本"

msgid "Reconnect"
msgstr "重新连接"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

msgid "Remove the FCC runtime and all of its data? This deletes the runtime, the agents, your configuration and every backup. It cannot be undone."
msgstr "移除 FCC 运行时及其全部数据？这将删除运行时、智能体、你的配置以及所有备份。此操作无法撤销。"

msgid "Remove the FCC runtime? Your configuration and data under the install path are kept."
msgstr "移除 FCC 运行时？安装路径下的配置和数据将被保留。"

msgid "Reset to recommended"
msgstr "恢复推荐选择"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

msgid "Retry"
msgstr "重试"

msgid "Run checks"
msgstr "运行检查"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Running checks…"
msgstr "正在运行检查…"

msgid "Save &amp; Apply"
msgstr "保存并应用"

msgid "Session has exited."
msgstr "会话已退出。"

msgid "Session is still running."
msgstr "会话仍在运行。"

msgid "Sessions are hosted by tmux on the router, so they survive a page reload or a browser restart. Closing a session from its tab ends the agent process."
msgstr "会话由路由器上的 tmux 托管，因此页面重新加载或浏览器重启后仍会保留。从标签页关闭会话将结束该智能体进程。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "设置已保存。"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "启动"

msgid "Start New Session"
msgstr "启动新会话"

msgid "Start on boot"
msgstr "开机自启"

msgid "Start the FCC server automatically and keep it supervised by procd."
msgstr "自动启动 FCC 服务器，并由 procd 持续守护。"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Stopping FCC Server may affect active Coding Agent sessions."
msgstr "停止 FCC 服务器可能会影响正在进行的编码智能体会话。"

msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储空间"

msgid "System"
msgstr "系统"

msgid "Terminal connection lost."
msgstr "终端连接已断开。"

msgid "The LuCI app version could not be checked — the router could not reach the version source."
msgstr "无法检查 LuCI 应用版本 —— 路由器无法访问版本源。"

msgid "The install path changed — install the runtime at the new location to use it."
msgstr "安装路径已更改 —— 请在新位置安装运行时后再使用。"

msgid "The operation failed."
msgstr "操作失败。"

msgid "This log is empty."
msgstr "此日志为空。"

msgid "To upgrade luci-app-fcc itself, run on the router:"
msgstr "如需升级 luci-app-fcc 本身，请在路由器上执行："

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载"

msgid "Uninstall and remove all data"
msgstr "卸载并清除所有数据"

msgid "Uninstall removes the runtime and the agents but keeps your configuration under the install path, so a later install finds it again. Uninstall and remove all data also deletes that configuration and every saved backup; there is no undo."
msgstr "卸载会移除运行时和智能体，但保留安装路径下的配置，以便日后重新安装时自动沿用。卸载并清除所有数据还会删除该配置及所有已保存的备份，且无法撤销。"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

msgid "Update FCC"
msgstr "更新 FCC"

msgid "Update the FCC runtime now? The server is stopped during the update and your data is kept."
msgstr "现在更新 FCC 运行时？更新期间服务器将停止，你的数据会被保留。"

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "更新"

msgid "Updating reinstalls the FCC runtime from upstream. If a step fails, the previous runtime is put back and your data is left in place."
msgstr "更新会从上游重新安装 FCC 运行时。若某一步失败，将恢复先前的运行时，你的数据保持不变。"

msgid "Uptime"
msgstr "运行时间"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Versions updated."
msgstr "版本已更新。"

msgid "View Log"
msgstr "查看日志"

msgid "Web Console"
msgstr "Web 控制台"

msgid "about %d MB"
msgstr "约 %d MB"

msgid "available"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "free"
msgstr "空闲"

msgid "healthy"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "installed"
msgstr "已安装"

msgid "listening"
msgstr "监听中"

msgid "needs %d MB RAM"
msgstr "需要 %d MB 内存"

msgid "not checked"
msgstr "未检查"

msgid "not installed"
msgstr "未安装"

msgid "not listening"
msgstr "未监听"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "unhealthy"
msgstr "异常"

msgid "up to date"
msgstr "已是最新"

msgid "update available"
msgstr "有可用更新"

msgid "uptime"
msgstr "运行时间"
